      "updated": 1794030521292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Time Complexity of Linear Search\n-----------------------------------------\n\n1. Best case\n---------------\n\nThe element present at the index 0 , in this case their will\nbe only one comparison .\n\nCn = O( 1 ) .\n\n\n2. Worst Case\n------------------\n\nThe element is present at last index or not present in the\narray . In this case their will be n comparision .\n\nCn = O ( n )\n\n\n3. Avg Case\n---------------\n\nThe element might be present in any position in the array .\n\nCn = 1 * 1/n  + 2 * 2/n + 3 * 1/n + ...............  n * 1/n\n\n    = 1/n  ( 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 +........ n )\n   \n    = 1/n  ( n ( n+1 )/2 )\n\n   =  ( n + 1 )/2\n\n   = n\n\nCn = O ( n )",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Time Complexity of Linear Search\n-----------------------------------------\n\n1. Best case\n---------------\n\nThe element present at the index 0 , in this case their will be only one comparison .\n\nCn = O( 1 ) .\n\n\n2. Worst Case\n------------------\n\nThe element is present at last index or not present in the array . In this case their will be n comparision .\n\nCn = O ( n )\n\n\n3. Avg Case\n---------------\n\nThe element might be present in any position in the array .\n\nCn = 1 * 1/n  + 2 * 2/n + 3 * 1/n + ...............  n * 1/n\n\n    = 1/n  ( 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 +........ n )\n   \n    = 1/n  ( n ( n+1 )/2 )\n\n   =  ( n + 1 )/2\n\n   = n\n\nCn = O ( n )",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
