      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Applied on Sorted Array .\n\n2. Cn = O ( log n ) because on every coparision array reduces to half .\n\n3. best case - element is at the mid -> O( 1 ) \n\n4. Worst case and Avg case -> O( log 2 n )",
